&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400;"&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>
